Files with Markdown is derived from the `files` mod shipped with Herdr App
0.1.13, part of the Herdr App project at https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes from the shipped Files mod: Markdown files render through
`TextView.markdown` (with a leading YAML frontmatter block hidden), images
render through `image()` after being copied into the app home (local reads, and
remote reads over `exec` as base64 with a PowerShell fallback), an open local
Markdown file or image reloads when it changes, and a right-click menu on
Markdown rows opens the optional Markdown Browser mod.

